<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Progressive cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Progressive cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had cut Progressive Corp's rating to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept the company's rating of long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed on Tuesday at 69-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
